<H1 align="center">Determining the Relationship Among Sets</H1>

<h3 align="center">
<A HREF="../../participants.html#Hong">Hoon Hong</A>,
      <A HREF="../../participants.html#Ratschan">Stefan Ratschan</A><br>
</h3>

Date: July 19th (Friday)<br>
Time: ??.??<br>

<center>
Abstract
</center>

Checking the entailment/disentailment of sets is an important
operation in constraint programming. We will generalize this problem to the
problem of answering queries about sets using a certain query language.
Furthermore we will present an efficient algorithm solving this problem for
arbitrary non-linear polynomials.


